    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The next day, reading the Blood Moon Gu recipe, Fang Yuan compares it against Golden Moon, Frost Moon, and Illusionary Moon Gu, the three classics of that line, whose refinement recipes run to almost a hundred thousand words of experience against Blood Moon Gu’s few thousand. He picks Blood Moon Gu instead, because it is far easier to feed than Golden Moon, Frost Moon, and Illusionary Moon, which still want moon orchid petals.",
